  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><ul><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong> euroguard designs premium home water filtration — gravity filters, undercounter systems and tap filters — built to improve the taste and quality of everyday tap water. Our systems use lead-free certified materials and are independently certified to NSF/ANSI 42 and 372 by IAPMO R&amp;T.</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong> Unlike generic filters, euroguard targets what UK households actually notice — chlorine taste and odour, limescale and microplastics — in a clean, design-led system that looks good on the worktop.</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong> 12% commission on every order with a 30-day cookie. Order values are high (full filtration systems), and replacement-cartridge repeat purchases mean recurring earning potential, not just one-off sales.</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong> Share your affiliate link or coupon across home, wellness, sustainability and family content — blogs, YouTube reviews, Instagram, TikTok and email. Product imagery and creative available on request.</li><li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Other information:</strong> UK-based brand, fast dispatch, responsive affiliate support. Applications reviewed personally — apply and we'll be in touch quickly.</li></ul></div></div>",
